file tools/fixtures/g/glow_desk_reach_scan.sh reads the worker's case pattern lines, gates sample_phantom at zero, splits the ratchet in two and derives the sum
file tools/fixtures/g/glow_desk_reach_control.sh twenty new readings, the two gates proven independent, and the dead runscan helper repaired
